    "summary": "This PR completes the `note` command: notes are now stored globally in `AddressBook` as a `Map<VisitDate, NoteContent>`, exposed to the UI through a new `plannerNote` observable property on `Model`/`ModelManager`, persisted through `JsonSerializableAddressBook`, and included in undo/redo snapshots via `AddressBook.resetData`. Reviewers should focus on the new null-flow between `ModelManager` and `PlannerListPanel` (the property is set to null on every navigation to a dateless view), on the save/load round trip of the note map, and on the semantics of repeatedly running `note` for the same date.",
